{"seq":3,"slug":"system-architecture","title":"研究生 系统工程 — 系统架构设计","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/engineering/systems-engineering-grad/foundations/system-architecture","wordCount":1788,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"研究生-系统工程-系统架构设计\">研究生 系统工程 — 系统架构设计</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>系统架构定义了系统的基本组织结构——组件的划分方式、组件间的接口关系以及指导设计与演化的核心原则。架构决策是系统生命周期中影响最深远且最难逆转的决策，它同时约束了性能上界、成本下界和可演化空间。</p>\n<p>系统架构设计的核心要素：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>功能架构（Functional Architecture）</strong>：描述系统执行的功能及其逻辑关系，独立于物理实现。功能通过输入-处理-输出链组织，形成功能流程图</li>\n<li><strong>物理架构（Physical Architecture）</strong>：将功能分配到具体的硬件、软件和人力组件上。功能到物理的映射不是一对一的——一个物理组件可能承载多个功能</li>\n<li><strong>分配架构（Allocated Architecture）</strong>：建立功能架构与物理架构之间的映射关系，是架构综合的核心步骤</li>\n<li><strong>接口架构（Interface Architecture）</strong>：定义组件间信息、能量和物质的交换协议</li>\n</ul>\n<p>架构的质量属性（Quality Attributes）如性能、可靠性、安全性和可维护性，需要在架构层面通过架构策略（Architectural Tactics）显式地设计进去，而非寄望于实现阶段弥补。</p>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"架构框架与视图\">架构框架与视图</h3><p>复杂系统的架构不可能用单一视图完整描述，因此需要多视图框架。主流的架构框架包括：</p>\n<p><strong>DoDAF（美国国防部架构框架）</strong> 定义了 8 个视点、52 种模型：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>视点</th>\n<th>关注点</th>\n<th>典型模型</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>All Viewpoint (AV)</td>\n<td>总体描述</td>\n<td>AV-1 概览, AV-2 词典</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Capability Viewpoint (CV)</td>\n<td>能力需求</td>\n<td>CV-1 愿景, CV-2 能力分类</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Operational Viewpoint (OV)</td>\n<td>作战流程</td>\n<td>OV-1 高层概念图, OV-2 资源流</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Systems Viewpoint (SV)</td>\n<td>系统与服务</td>\n<td>SV-1 接口描述, SV-4 功能描述</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Services Viewpoint (SvcV)</td>\n<td>服务化架构</td>\n<td>SvcV-1 服务上下文</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Standards Viewpoint (StdV)</td>\n<td>标准合规</td>\n<td>StdV-1 标准剖面</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Data and Information (DIV)</td>\n<td>数据模型</td>\n<td>DIV-1 概念数据模型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Project Viewpoint (PV)</td>\n<td>项目规划</td>\n<td>PV-1 项目组合关系</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>ISO/IEC/IEEE 42010</strong> 提供了更通用的架构描述标准，核心概念为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Architecture Description</mtext><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mtext>Stakeholder</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>Concern</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>Viewpoint</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>View</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>Model</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Architecture Description} = \\{\\text{Stakeholder}, \\text{Concern}, \\text{Viewpoint}, \\text{View}, \\text{Model}\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Architecture Description</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Stakeholder</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Concern</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Viewpoint</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">View</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Model</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>每个 Viewpoint 面向特定的利益相关方群体和关注点，通过 View（视图）实例化，View 中包含一个或多个 Model。</p>\n<h3 id=\"架构综合方法\">架构综合方法</h3><p>架构综合是从需求空间到设计空间的创造性映射过程。常用方法包括：</p>\n<p><strong>形态矩阵法（Morphological Analysis）</strong>：将系统功能列为行，每行列出可能的实现方案，组合不同行的方案形成候选架构。若有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 个功能，第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 个功能有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 种方案，候选架构总数为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>candidates</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∏</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></munderover><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{\\text{candidates}} = \\prod_{i=1}^{k} n_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">candidates</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.1138em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8361em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∏</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>实践中通过不兼容性排除和领域知识约束可大幅缩减搜索空间。</p>\n<p><strong>架构权衡分析方法（ATAM）</strong> 是 Carnegie Mellon SEI 提出的架构评估方法，通过场景驱动的方式识别架构风险：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>收集架构驱动因素（业务目标 + 质量属性）</li>\n<li>生成质量属性效用树（Utility Tree）</li>\n<li>对关键场景逐一分析架构响应</li>\n<li>识别敏感点（Sensitivity Points）和权衡点（Tradeoffs）</li>\n<li>输出风险、非风险和权衡清单</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"模块化与接口设计\">模块化与接口设计</h3><p>模块化设计的理论基础来自 Herbert Simon 的&quot;近可分解系统&quot;（Nearly Decomposable Systems）理论：良好的架构应使模块内交互远强于模块间交互。</p>\n<p>设计结构矩阵（Design Structure Matrix, DSM）是分析和优化模块化的标准工具。给定 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个元素，DSM 为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n \\times n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 的布尔矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span>，其中：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mtext>元素 </mtext><mi>i</mi><mtext> 依赖元素 </mtext><mi>j</mi></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>否则</mtext></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_{ij} = \\begin{cases} 1, &amp; \\text{元素 } i \\text{ 依赖元素 } j \\\\ 0, &amp; \\text{否则} \\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3em;vertical-align:-1.25em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">{</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.69em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.69em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.19em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:1em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.69em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.69em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">元素</span><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">依赖元素</span><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">否则</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.19em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>通过行列置换（聚类算法），将 DSM 变换为近块对角形式，每个对角块对应一个高内聚模块。聚类质量可用模块化指标 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span> 衡量：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfrac><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></munder><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow><mi>δ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q = \\frac{1}{2m}\\sum_{ij}\\left[D_{ij} - \\frac{k_i k_j}{2m}\\right]\\delta(c_i, c_j)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.8638em;vertical-align:-1.4138em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;